1
00:00:01,001 --> 00:00:04,587
[theme music playing]

2
00:00:05,547 --> 00:00:06,673
[gunshots]

3
00:00:06,756 --> 00:00:07,966
[gun clicks, fires]

4
00:00:09,426 --> 00:00:10,677
[whoosh, slashing sounds]

5
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:12,679
[machine gun fire]

6
00:00:12,762 --> 00:00:14,681
[machine gun fire continues]

7
00:00:14,764 --> 00:00:15,765
[single gunshot]

8
00:00:17,976 --> 00:00:19,936
[rapid gunfire]

9
00:00:20,979 --> 00:00:22,397
[echoing blast]

10
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:24,107
[rapid gunfire]

11
00:00:24,858 --> 00:00:25,942
[blade whooshing]

12
00:00:26,025 --> 00:00:28,445
[tense music builds]

13
00:00:28,528 --> 00:00:29,654
[blade whooshing]

14
00:00:32,282 --> 00:00:34,075
[Camia] <i>Your father always wanted</i>

15
00:00:34,159 --> 00:00:36,411
<i>to walk you down the aisle</i>
<i>at your wedding.</i>

16
00:00:36,494 --> 00:00:37,787
[Diego] <i>I can't wait.</i>

17
00:00:37,871 --> 00:00:40,999
<i>I'm so excited to start</i>
<i>my new life with my wife.</i>

18
00:00:41,082 --> 00:00:42,792
<i>Mayor, we've tracked them down.</i>

19
00:00:42,876 --> 00:00:45,295
<i>They're at the St. Monica</i>
<i>chapel in Rosario.</i>

20
00:00:45,378 --> 00:00:47,589
<i>Lily, no matter how many times I fall,</i>

21
00:00:47,672 --> 00:00:49,758
<i>no matter how many times I get hurt,</i>

22
00:00:49,841 --> 00:00:51,885
<i>I'll never stop loving you.</i>

23
00:00:51,968 --> 00:00:56,347
<i>I promise to love you</i>
<i>until my last breath.</i>

24
00:00:56,431 --> 00:00:59,726
[Lily] <i>The love we share</i>
<i>is among the few good things</i>

25
00:00:59,809 --> 00:01:02,020
<i>going on in my life right now.</i>

26
00:01:02,103 --> 00:01:04,564
<i>I'm very happy right now, Diego.</i>

27
00:01:04,647 --> 00:01:07,567
[Arnaldo] <i>I found Lily and Diego.</i>
<i>And guess what?</i>

28
00:01:07,650 --> 00:01:09,652
<i>They just got married. I wasn't invited.</i>

29
00:01:09,736 --> 00:01:11,237
<i>Come home. Leave them there.</i>

30
00:01:11,321 --> 00:01:13,073
[Arnaldo] <i>But I want to thank you</i>

31
00:01:13,156 --> 00:01:15,241
<i>for always taking care of me.</i>

32
00:01:15,325 --> 00:01:16,576
<i>I love you.</i>

33
00:01:16,659 --> 00:01:19,454
[Julio] <i>And I love you too, my son.</i>
<i>You always remember that.</i>

34
00:01:19,537 --> 00:01:24,292
[Diego] <i>I think I'm the happiest</i>
<i>and luckiest guy on earth,</i>

35
00:01:24,375 --> 00:01:26,336
<i>Mrs. Lily Cruz-Torillo.</i>

36
00:01:26,419 --> 00:01:27,545
[Dante] <i>Lily.</i>

37
00:01:27,629 --> 00:01:28,880
<i>Dad.</i>

38
00:01:28,963 --> 00:01:31,966
<i>Lily, your lives are in danger. Wake up.</i>

39
00:01:40,016 --> 00:01:45,355
[ominous music playing]

40
00:02:07,085 --> 00:02:08,795
[Arnaldo] Be quiet and don't move.

41
00:02:08,878 --> 00:02:13,133
Shh. Sorry. Sorry for ruining
your honeymoon. Quiet.

42
00:02:13,216 --> 00:02:14,759
I'm here to kill your husband.

43
00:02:16,136 --> 00:02:19,222
I'll end his life tonight.

44
00:02:25,436 --> 00:02:26,813
[groans]

45
00:02:30,358 --> 00:02:31,234
Dieg--

46
00:02:36,823 --> 00:02:38,074
[grunts] Diego!

47
00:02:38,950 --> 00:02:40,326
-Shut up!
-Dieg--

48
00:02:54,215 --> 00:02:55,258
-[grunts]
-[groans]

49
00:02:55,341 --> 00:03:00,346
[dramatic music playing]

50
00:03:06,144 --> 00:03:07,145
Diego.

51
00:03:14,277 --> 00:03:15,737
-[grunts]
-[groans]

52
00:03:21,492 --> 00:03:22,619
Come here.

53
00:03:30,501 --> 00:03:31,711
[screams]

54
00:03:32,962 --> 00:03:33,963
No!

55
00:03:44,599 --> 00:03:49,604
[dark music playing]

56
00:04:54,460 --> 00:04:55,628
[Arnaldo] Lily!

57
00:04:57,880 --> 00:04:59,340
Come back here!

58
00:05:01,759 --> 00:05:02,844
I said come back!

59
00:05:04,012 --> 00:05:05,013
Lily!

60
00:05:20,945 --> 00:05:25,742
[suspenseful music playing]

61
00:05:29,537 --> 00:05:30,538
[grunts]

62
00:05:33,833 --> 00:05:35,168
You bastard!

63
00:05:35,960 --> 00:05:38,046
-[Arnaldo grunts]
-[Lily groans]

64
00:05:41,966 --> 00:05:42,800
No!

65
00:05:42,884 --> 00:05:44,969
[screams] Somebody, help her!

66
00:05:47,096 --> 00:05:48,639
Don't you get it? It's just us now.

67
00:05:48,723 --> 00:05:50,850
You're all mine. All mine!

68
00:05:50,933 --> 00:05:52,935
I'll… I'll never be yours!

69
00:05:53,019 --> 00:05:54,062
-[grunts]
-[groans]

70
00:05:59,776 --> 00:06:00,735
[Lily cries]

71
00:06:00,818 --> 00:06:01,903
Don't! Arnaldo!

72
00:06:01,986 --> 00:06:04,238
[screaming]

73
00:06:04,989 --> 00:06:06,032
[Lily grunts]

74
00:06:09,702 --> 00:06:14,707
[ominous music playing]

75
00:06:23,716 --> 00:06:25,510
-[gunshots]
-Arnaldo!

76
00:06:25,593 --> 00:06:27,011
[gunshots]

77
00:06:27,095 --> 00:06:27,970
Arnaldo!

78
00:06:29,222 --> 00:06:30,681
Get your hands off my wife!

79
00:06:35,853 --> 00:06:37,396
I'll never let you be happy!

80
00:06:39,023 --> 00:06:41,400
[Arnaldo screaming]

81
00:06:41,484 --> 00:06:42,443
[Diego groans]

82
00:06:54,914 --> 00:06:59,919
[suspenseful music playing]

83
00:07:04,173 --> 00:07:05,758
[Arnaldo] I don't care if you have a gun!

84
00:07:05,842 --> 00:07:07,093
I don't give a damn!

85
00:07:11,222 --> 00:07:12,223
[Diego grunting]

86
00:07:21,566 --> 00:07:23,860
[Arnaldo] Go ahead! Come on!

87
00:07:23,943 --> 00:07:25,027
-Diego!
-Come on!

88
00:07:25,111 --> 00:07:27,488
-Arnaldo, stop this!
-No!

89
00:07:29,740 --> 00:07:31,534
[groaning]

90
00:07:31,617 --> 00:07:32,660
Diego!

91
00:07:37,081 --> 00:07:37,999
Diego!

92
00:07:38,082 --> 00:07:39,125
[Diego groaning]

93
00:07:42,086 --> 00:07:47,091
[suspenseful music playing]

94
00:07:54,807 --> 00:07:55,808
[Diego groans]

95
00:08:02,732 --> 00:08:03,733
Don't!

96
00:08:03,941 --> 00:08:05,443
Arnaldo, don't!

97
00:08:07,153 --> 00:08:08,488
[Diego] No! Arnaldo!

98
00:08:09,030 --> 00:08:10,156
[Diego] Lily!

99
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:15,995
[Diego] Arnaldo! Arnaldo!

100
00:08:19,624 --> 00:08:20,708
[Lily] Don't do this!

101
00:08:21,709 --> 00:08:23,753
Don't kill your brother!

102
00:08:25,796 --> 00:08:26,964
[Diego groaning]

103
00:08:29,425 --> 00:08:32,929
Arnaldo! Arnaldo, please!
Please, stop this!

104
00:08:34,055 --> 00:08:38,601
We're begging you, please stop! Just stop!

105
00:08:39,310 --> 00:08:40,728
I'll never let you be happy!

106
00:08:42,855 --> 00:08:43,898
Never.

107
00:08:45,775 --> 00:08:50,363
Go ahead. Just do it. Go ahead, Arnaldo!

108
00:08:53,115 --> 00:08:56,035
Pull it! Pull the trigger!

109
00:08:56,619 --> 00:08:59,205
Do it, Arnaldo! Kill us!

110
00:08:59,288 --> 00:09:03,876
If you're going to kill Diego,
you might as well kill me too!

111
00:09:05,503 --> 00:09:10,424
I'd rather die and join him in death!

112
00:09:10,508 --> 00:09:11,801
But you?

113
00:09:13,511 --> 00:09:18,641
As long as you live, no one
will ever love you, Arnaldo!

114
00:09:21,269 --> 00:09:23,938
No one! Because you're a monster!

115
00:09:25,231 --> 00:09:29,277
I'll never forget how
you killed Nanny Carlotta!

116
00:09:31,070 --> 00:09:34,240
And even if you let me live,
I will never love you!

117
00:09:34,323 --> 00:09:38,619
I will never love you!
I will never love a criminal!

118
00:09:41,956 --> 00:09:43,207
[Lily] <i>Monster!</i>

119
00:09:43,291 --> 00:09:46,586
<i>-I didn't mean--</i>
<i>-You bastard! I don't love you!</i>

120
00:09:46,669 --> 00:09:48,838
<i>I'll never love a demon like you!</i>

121
00:09:48,921 --> 00:09:50,881
<i>A monster! I don't love you!</i>

122
00:09:50,965 --> 00:09:53,092
<i>-You love me!</i>
<i>-I used you!</i>

123
00:09:53,175 --> 00:09:54,552
<i>I never really loved you.</i>

124
00:09:54,635 --> 00:09:57,221
<i>I'd never fall in love with a criminal!</i>

125
00:09:57,305 --> 00:10:01,183
<i>I'd never fall for an Ardiente!</i>

126
00:10:03,978 --> 00:10:05,104
Stop this!

127
00:10:10,067 --> 00:10:12,945
[Lily] <i>No one will ever love you, Arnaldo!</i>

128
00:10:13,029 --> 00:10:15,781
<i>Because I will never love you!</i>
<i>I will never love you!</i>

129
00:10:15,865 --> 00:10:17,533
[screams]

130
00:10:17,617 --> 00:10:18,618
[gunshot]

131
00:10:20,494 --> 00:10:25,499
[dramatic music playing]

132
00:10:37,762 --> 00:10:42,767
[somber music playing]

133
00:11:15,466 --> 00:11:17,593
Arnaldo. Arnaldo…

134
00:11:17,676 --> 00:11:20,679
[Diego sobbing]

135
00:11:26,977 --> 00:11:31,941
[somber music playing]

136
00:12:23,325 --> 00:12:28,330
[somber music playing]

137
00:12:37,423 --> 00:12:38,966
Where's my grandson?

138
00:12:53,397 --> 00:12:54,398
[sobs]

139
00:13:26,597 --> 00:13:30,267
No! No! No!

140
00:13:30,351 --> 00:13:32,269
Arnaldo! No!

141
00:13:32,353 --> 00:13:33,687
Arnaldo!

142
00:13:35,189 --> 00:13:37,191
[sobbing]

143
00:13:38,692 --> 00:13:40,444
Arnaldo!

144
00:13:42,821 --> 00:13:46,992
Arnaldo, why? Why?

145
00:13:48,744 --> 00:13:49,995
Why?!

146
00:14:16,939 --> 00:14:18,482
-Ma'am Emilia.
-Yes?

147
00:14:19,859 --> 00:14:21,193
Your son's gone.

148
00:14:21,777 --> 00:14:24,280
Huh? What do you mean?

149
00:14:25,865 --> 00:14:29,159
Mayor Arnaldo's gone. He's dead.

150
00:14:31,078 --> 00:14:33,330
Dead? Are you nuts?

151
00:14:33,914 --> 00:14:37,334
Stop making up stories. Get out of here!

152
00:14:38,544 --> 00:14:40,963
Arnaldo's dead?
What are you talking about?

153
00:14:43,132 --> 00:14:46,844
He even said he would visit me. He said…

154
00:14:48,178 --> 00:14:49,638
<i>I'll be gone for a while.</i>

155
00:14:50,890 --> 00:14:52,266
<i>You're leaving?</i>

156
00:14:52,850 --> 00:14:55,060
<i>-Yeah. I have to go.</i>
<i>-Huh?</i>

157
00:14:56,520 --> 00:14:57,646
<i>I have to go.</i>

158
00:15:00,816 --> 00:15:01,942
[chuckles]

159
00:15:06,530 --> 00:15:07,781
<i>Arnaldo…</i>

160
00:15:09,950 --> 00:15:14,955
[melancholic music playing]

161
00:15:35,726 --> 00:15:36,936
Arnaldo?

162
00:15:43,817 --> 00:15:45,152
Arnaldo?

163
00:15:47,237 --> 00:15:48,572
Arnaldo!

164
00:15:49,907 --> 00:15:50,950
Raul!

165
00:15:51,367 --> 00:15:52,409
Mama!

166
00:15:56,747 --> 00:15:58,749
[wailing]

167
00:16:02,336 --> 00:16:05,422
He's gone!

168
00:16:10,511 --> 00:16:12,262
My son!

169
00:16:21,063 --> 00:16:26,068
[melancholic music playing]

170
00:17:02,604 --> 00:17:04,189
Leave me. Leave me!

171
00:17:04,857 --> 00:17:07,401
Leave me! Leave me!

172
00:17:08,277 --> 00:17:09,820
[Julio sobbing]

173
00:17:11,989 --> 00:17:15,117
What did you do to my little boy?

174
00:17:17,119 --> 00:17:20,497
Why did you do this to my grandson?

175
00:17:22,416 --> 00:17:24,501
Arnaldo!

176
00:17:26,253 --> 00:17:28,213
Wh-- Why…

177
00:17:28,297 --> 00:17:31,300
Why did you hurt my little boy?

178
00:17:33,677 --> 00:17:35,763
You didn't listen to me.

179
00:17:36,055 --> 00:17:39,516
I told you… I told you to be careful.

180
00:17:39,808 --> 00:17:41,477
Be careful.

181
00:17:41,560 --> 00:17:44,021
Who… Who did this to you?

182
00:17:44,104 --> 00:17:46,940
My little boy!

183
00:17:56,950 --> 00:18:01,038
Blood will be paid with blood.

184
00:18:02,581 --> 00:18:04,625
I promise you that, Arnaldo.

185
00:18:06,001 --> 00:18:08,337
I… I promise you.

186
00:18:11,131 --> 00:18:13,092
My little boy!

187
00:18:14,843 --> 00:18:16,762
Wh-- Why…

188
00:18:16,845 --> 00:18:19,556
Why did they do this to you?

189
00:18:27,731 --> 00:18:30,776
Why? Why?

190
00:18:36,323 --> 00:18:37,991
[tense music playing]

191
00:18:52,589 --> 00:18:54,258
[melancholic music playing]

192
00:19:01,014 --> 00:19:02,057
Diego.

193
00:19:02,516 --> 00:19:03,976
-Mom.
-Lily, dear.

194
00:19:08,021 --> 00:19:09,565
-Diego.
-Mom.

195
00:19:19,241 --> 00:19:21,743
-We only wanted to…
-Diego, Miss Lily.

196
00:19:22,494 --> 00:19:24,496
Is Arnaldo really gone?

197
00:19:29,209 --> 00:19:31,795
We didn't want Arnaldo to die.

198
00:19:35,966 --> 00:19:37,676
I wish I could've saved him.

199
00:19:41,847 --> 00:19:43,515
Because of what he did…

200
00:19:45,058 --> 00:19:48,103
it's like he had paid for
all the crimes he had done.

201
00:19:51,231 --> 00:19:53,525
He will never hurt anyone again.

202
00:19:57,196 --> 00:19:58,614
Please excuse me.

203
00:20:01,491 --> 00:20:02,951
I'll follow in a bit.

204
00:20:15,047 --> 00:20:16,924
For those of us who've lost loved ones…

205
00:20:23,388 --> 00:20:25,307
with Arnaldo's death…

206
00:20:28,310 --> 00:20:30,604
it just goes to show that

207
00:20:30,687 --> 00:20:34,983
whether you're rich or poor,
powerful or weak,

208
00:20:35,984 --> 00:20:41,073
what you do to others
will always come back to you.

209
00:20:41,156 --> 00:20:44,993
<i>Who did this to you?!</i>

210
00:20:46,453 --> 00:20:48,497
<i>Tell me!</i>

211
00:20:53,502 --> 00:20:55,170
[sobbing]

212
00:20:56,880 --> 00:20:58,006
<i>-Nimfa!</i>
<i>-Mister Fernan!</i>

213
00:20:58,090 --> 00:20:59,258
<i>Nimfa!</i>

214
00:20:59,341 --> 00:21:00,717
<i>Mayor!</i>

215
00:21:02,844 --> 00:21:03,762
[gunshot]

216
00:21:04,930 --> 00:21:09,101
[melancholic music playing]

217
00:21:16,400 --> 00:21:18,068
[bleak music playing]

218
00:21:23,824 --> 00:21:26,827
[sobbing]

219
00:21:35,460 --> 00:21:36,670
Why?

220
00:21:39,506 --> 00:21:42,718
Why did you take my grandson?

221
00:21:44,970 --> 00:21:46,054
Why?!

222
00:21:51,310 --> 00:21:53,854
He wasn't doing anything wrong!

223
00:21:55,314 --> 00:21:57,441
He was a good boy!

224
00:21:58,442 --> 00:22:01,320
He was a good boy!

225
00:22:30,807 --> 00:22:31,975
Why?

226
00:22:37,189 --> 00:22:38,482
He was…

227
00:22:43,987 --> 00:22:46,073
He was my only hope!

228
00:22:46,740 --> 00:22:51,203
He was my only hope!

229
00:22:52,788 --> 00:22:54,206
Damn you!

230
00:22:59,002 --> 00:23:00,962
What am I now, huh?

231
00:23:02,089 --> 00:23:04,633
What am I now?

232
00:23:15,602 --> 00:23:20,565
[ominous music playing]

233
00:23:25,278 --> 00:23:26,279
[mumbles]

234
00:23:47,634 --> 00:23:49,302
[gunshot]

235
00:23:49,386 --> 00:23:52,013
Was that a gunshot?
What are you waiting for?

236
00:23:52,097 --> 00:23:54,558
Get the kids inside! Hurry!

237
00:23:55,058 --> 00:23:56,935
-Dude! Dude!
-Where did that come from?

238
00:23:57,018 --> 00:23:58,603
It came from the governor's mansion!

239
00:23:58,687 --> 00:24:00,355
-Thanks, man. Let's go!
-Okay.

240
00:24:02,023 --> 00:24:04,234
[breathing heavily]

241
00:24:09,948 --> 00:24:10,907
[knocking]

242
00:24:10,991 --> 00:24:12,534
Let me out of here!

243
00:24:13,451 --> 00:24:17,581
Let me out of here! Let me out!

244
00:24:19,207 --> 00:24:20,208
[gunshot]

245
00:24:21,459 --> 00:24:22,460
[gunshot]

246
00:24:24,462 --> 00:24:26,590
I'm coming for you!

247
00:24:26,673 --> 00:24:30,552
I will be coming for each
and every one of you!

248
00:24:31,761 --> 00:24:33,805
Please let me out!

249
00:24:36,224 --> 00:24:39,352
[whimpering]

250
00:24:46,735 --> 00:24:47,819
[whimpering]

251
00:25:02,042 --> 00:25:07,047
[ominous music playing]

252
00:25:08,256 --> 00:25:10,258
[shrieks]

253
00:25:27,776 --> 00:25:29,319
[Julio] No. No…

254
00:25:29,945 --> 00:25:30,946
No!

255
00:25:43,291 --> 00:25:44,292
<i>Dad…</i>

256
00:25:45,543 --> 00:25:48,797
<i>I promised you that</i>
<i>I'd take care of Arnaldo.</i>

257
00:25:50,799 --> 00:25:53,176
<i>I tried to help him change.</i>

258
00:25:55,595 --> 00:25:56,888
<i>But I failed.</i>

259
00:25:58,932 --> 00:26:01,434
<i>I failed, so please forgive me.</i>

260
00:26:02,727 --> 00:26:05,188
<i>I wasn't able to save my brother.</i>

261
00:26:06,773 --> 00:26:11,778
[melancholic music playing]

262
00:27:25,352 --> 00:27:30,315
[somber music playing]

263
00:28:38,174 --> 00:28:40,385
<i>I built an empire</i>

264
00:28:41,594 --> 00:28:47,642
<i>so that you wouldn't have</i>
<i>to lay down on a bed of thorns.</i>

265
00:28:52,522 --> 00:28:57,527
[funeral music playing]

266
00:29:20,842 --> 00:29:24,053
<i>I've killed countless enemies.</i>

267
00:29:24,929 --> 00:29:29,559
<i>All to make sure that</i>
<i>you'd live in paradise.</i>

268
00:30:24,447 --> 00:30:26,491
<i>But in the blink of an eye,</i>

269
00:30:27,784 --> 00:30:30,203
<i>they took you away from me.</i>

270
00:30:31,329 --> 00:30:36,334
[somber music playing]

271
00:32:21,147 --> 00:32:23,733
<i>Rest now, my prince…</i>

272
00:32:29,948 --> 00:32:35,203
<i>for I will burn the whole</i>
<i>town of Ardiente to ashes</i>

273
00:32:36,287 --> 00:32:38,331
<i>to avenge your death.</i>

274
00:32:38,414 --> 00:32:43,419
[somber music playing]

275
00:32:58,267 --> 00:33:03,231
[ominous music playing]

276
00:34:03,207 --> 00:34:08,212
[somber music playing]

277
00:34:23,186 --> 00:34:24,937
-What do we do?
-We should wait…

278
00:34:25,021 --> 00:34:27,356
-for ma'am and sir.
-Yes, sir.

279
00:34:33,154 --> 00:34:38,159
[ominous music playing]

280
00:34:44,540 --> 00:34:45,958
Sir, somebody left this.

281
00:34:47,376 --> 00:34:48,586
Who's it from?

282
00:34:57,095 --> 00:34:59,972
Julio Ardiente and his threats again.

283
00:35:00,056 --> 00:35:01,015
Mom!

284
00:35:02,600 --> 00:35:04,102
Don't go near the coffins.

285
00:35:11,984 --> 00:35:13,778
Get away from there!

286
00:35:13,861 --> 00:35:15,613
[explosion]

287
00:35:24,997 --> 00:35:26,666
-Head inside!
-Hurry!

288
00:35:29,710 --> 00:35:31,170
[Diego] Go! Stay alert!

289
00:35:34,048 --> 00:35:39,053
[ominous music playing]

290
00:35:51,941 --> 00:35:52,733
Governor.

291
00:35:53,860 --> 00:35:56,070
We already sent the coffins
to Diego and Lily's house.

292
00:35:56,946 --> 00:35:58,447
What's your next move?

293
00:35:59,949 --> 00:36:02,243
We'll ask for the Triad's help.

294
00:36:05,163 --> 00:36:07,623
We will strengthen our forces.

295
00:36:11,294 --> 00:36:15,173
And just like what
my grandson Arnaldo wanted,

296
00:36:16,174 --> 00:36:21,262
we will make Lily and Diego
cry tears of blood.

297
00:36:22,889 --> 00:36:27,852
[ominous music playing]

298
00:36:34,275 --> 00:36:38,404
Dearest children of Poblacion Ardiente…

299
00:36:43,701 --> 00:36:47,830
<i>My grandson, Arnaldo,</i>
<i>was mercilessly killed…</i>

300
00:36:49,957 --> 00:36:54,003
<i>by Lily and Diego Torillo.</i>

301
00:36:58,966 --> 00:37:02,595
<i>They killed your beloved Mayor Arnaldo…</i>

302
00:37:04,639 --> 00:37:06,974
<i>who wanted nothing…</i>

303
00:37:08,476 --> 00:37:11,229
<i>but to improve your lives</i>

304
00:37:12,647 --> 00:37:17,485
and to serve you
to the best of his abilities.

305
00:37:18,945 --> 00:37:22,240
That's why now I'm beseeching you…

306
00:37:23,491 --> 00:37:26,285
<i>We should not allow these monsters</i>

307
00:37:27,245 --> 00:37:30,373
<i>to keep abusing us like this.</i>

308
00:37:31,332 --> 00:37:37,171
<i>Please help me seek justice for</i>
<i>the murder of Mayor Arnaldo.</i>

309
00:37:38,005 --> 00:37:40,049
We need to make sure

310
00:37:40,132 --> 00:37:41,968
these criminals own up to their crimes.

311
00:37:43,636 --> 00:37:46,973
We need to make them pay for their sins.

312
00:37:48,140 --> 00:37:54,522
Help me make Lily and Diego Torillo pay.

313
00:37:55,398 --> 00:37:59,402
<i>Because they are the true criminals.</i>

314
00:38:00,152 --> 00:38:04,282
<i>They are the scum</i>
<i>who want to ruin our town.</i>

315
00:38:04,365 --> 00:38:05,491
That's right.

316
00:38:05,992 --> 00:38:07,827
Justice for the mayor!

317
00:38:07,910 --> 00:38:11,414
-Kill those criminals!
-Kill them!

318
00:38:11,497 --> 00:38:15,668
[chanting] Justice! Justice! Justice!

319
00:38:16,002 --> 00:38:20,923
Justice! Justice! Justice! Justice!

320
00:38:21,007 --> 00:38:24,593
Justice! Justice! Justice!

321
00:38:24,677 --> 00:38:29,348
Justice! Justice! Justice! Justice!

322
00:38:29,432 --> 00:38:32,727
Justice! Justice! Justice!

323
00:38:32,810 --> 00:38:37,231
<i>Justice! Justice! Justice! Justice!</i>

324
00:38:37,315 --> 00:38:40,443
<i>Justice! Justice! Justice!</i>

325
00:38:40,526 --> 00:38:43,112
-Get out of there!
-[clamoring]

326
00:38:43,195 --> 00:38:46,407
-Justice for the mayor!
-Don't cause trouble here!

327
00:38:46,490 --> 00:38:52,163
All you do is cause trouble!
What do you even want to happen?

328
00:38:52,705 --> 00:38:56,542
Just leave! What are you doing?

329
00:38:57,251 --> 00:39:00,338
You're all blind followers.
They paid you to do this!

330
00:39:02,131 --> 00:39:03,966
Ma'am, there's a commotion outside!

331
00:39:04,300 --> 00:39:07,636
[commotion continues]

332
00:39:07,720 --> 00:39:09,055
[Fernan] You can't be here!

333
00:39:11,140 --> 00:39:16,187
[commotion continues]

334
00:39:33,829 --> 00:39:36,624
Stay alert. And deploy more men.

335
00:39:36,707 --> 00:39:37,750
Yes, ma'am.

336
00:39:41,837 --> 00:39:43,339
[Camia] Diego, Lily…

337
00:39:44,048 --> 00:39:49,345
Julio is manipulating the people
of Ardiente to go against you.

338
00:39:49,428 --> 00:39:52,640
Only his blind followers believe Julio.

339
00:39:52,723 --> 00:39:54,016
But, Lily…

340
00:39:54,975 --> 00:39:56,727
Julio wants revenge.

341
00:39:57,520 --> 00:39:58,813
Please be careful.

342
00:39:59,814 --> 00:40:01,774
He has no right to seek revenge.

343
00:40:03,109 --> 00:40:07,613
Arnaldo ended up that way
because of Julio and Emilia.

344
00:40:08,531 --> 00:40:10,324
Diego, he's already begun.

345
00:40:10,616 --> 00:40:11,909
He can try.

346
00:40:12,159 --> 00:40:15,329
Julio can do whatever he wants,
we're not afraid.

347
00:40:15,413 --> 00:40:18,124
Diego and I didn't do anything wrong.

348
00:40:18,207 --> 00:40:21,752
We didn't kill his grandson.
He killed himself.

349
00:40:23,003 --> 00:40:27,550
No matter what he does,
the public won't believe him.

350
00:40:27,925 --> 00:40:29,885
Because they all know

351
00:40:29,969 --> 00:40:32,430
that Diego and I are
fighting for what's right.

352
00:40:42,606 --> 00:40:44,233
[commotion continues]

353
00:40:47,695 --> 00:40:50,906
Dragon ladies, I need you
to come here now.

354
00:40:51,365 --> 00:40:54,702
Because you have to save my son's life.

355
00:40:55,244 --> 00:40:59,415
He is in danger.
Please, come now. Okay? Now!

356
00:41:00,207 --> 00:41:03,419
And, Raul, where are you? Where are you?!

357
00:41:03,502 --> 00:41:05,588
I need you to save our son's life!

358
00:41:05,671 --> 00:41:08,799
He's in danger! Come on!

359
00:41:21,061 --> 00:41:24,732
Enough, Emilia. Enough.

360
00:41:26,817 --> 00:41:28,736
Stop this insanity.

361
00:41:30,988 --> 00:41:33,073
Your son is dead!

362
00:41:33,824 --> 00:41:37,578
Arnaldo is dead! Do you understand?

363
00:41:38,871 --> 00:41:40,456
Arnaldo is dead.

364
00:41:41,624 --> 00:41:45,169
Lily and Diego killed him.

365
00:41:47,296 --> 00:41:48,964
Do you understand?

366
00:41:50,299 --> 00:41:51,675
He's dead!

367
00:41:51,967 --> 00:41:56,555
[shushes] Papa, no! No! No, no!

368
00:41:57,515 --> 00:42:00,768
You're lying! You're lying! Mama!

369
00:42:00,851 --> 00:42:04,855
Please, let's save him! Please! Come on!

370
00:42:08,943 --> 00:42:10,402
Arnaldo!

371
00:42:12,947 --> 00:42:16,825
Enough. Enough, Emilia.

372
00:42:22,706 --> 00:42:25,125
Stop this nonsense.

373
00:42:26,877 --> 00:42:30,548
We're the only Ardientes left!

374
00:42:32,341 --> 00:42:38,597
Prove to me that you deserve
to be called an Ardiente.

375
00:42:41,183 --> 00:42:42,685
Help me!

376
00:42:44,103 --> 00:42:48,482
Help me seek revenge for your son Arnaldo!

377
00:42:50,651 --> 00:42:51,652
Please!

378
00:42:55,406 --> 00:42:58,534
Please! Please!

379
00:43:02,580 --> 00:43:03,872
Please!

380
00:43:19,638 --> 00:43:22,349
[Fernan] All you do is cause trouble!

381
00:43:22,975 --> 00:43:25,978
What do you even want to happen?
Just leave already!

382
00:43:26,061 --> 00:43:28,230
We need to move to a different town.

383
00:43:28,314 --> 00:43:30,190
But our livelihood is here.

384
00:43:30,274 --> 00:43:32,985
What if Governor Julio attacks us?

385
00:43:33,068 --> 00:43:37,531
[woman] We have to move.
It's not safe here anymore.

386
00:43:37,615 --> 00:43:40,159
Uh, excuse me. What's going on here?

387
00:43:40,242 --> 00:43:42,911
The supporters of Governor Julio
are holding a demonstration

388
00:43:42,995 --> 00:43:44,872
in front of Lily Cruz's house.

389
00:43:44,955 --> 00:43:47,708
And yesterday, they planted
bombs in some coffins.

390
00:43:47,791 --> 00:43:49,168
-Lily Cruz lives here?
-Yeah.

391
00:43:49,251 --> 00:43:52,504
But if I were you, I'd stay away
from here to avoid their mess.

392
00:43:52,588 --> 00:43:54,632
-Let's go.
-Thank you.

393
00:43:59,386 --> 00:44:04,391
[commotion continues]

394
00:44:14,526 --> 00:44:18,280
[Helena] <i>Emilia! Help me! I'm on fire!</i>

395
00:44:18,947 --> 00:44:21,533
<i>Snap out of your insanity!</i>

396
00:44:21,617 --> 00:44:26,747
<i>Help me and your son Arnaldo!</i>
<i>Kill them all!</i>

397
00:44:27,748 --> 00:44:29,541
[Helena] <i>Emilia!</i>

398
00:44:30,125 --> 00:44:31,710
[Arnaldo] <i>I… I need you.</i>

399
00:44:32,211 --> 00:44:33,170
<i>I--I need you.</i>

400
00:44:33,253 --> 00:44:36,048
<i>I need you to make them pay for my death.</i>

401
00:44:36,131 --> 00:44:37,883
<i>Mom, I need you.</i>

402
00:44:38,509 --> 00:44:41,261
<i>Make them pay. They killed me.</i>

403
00:44:41,762 --> 00:44:45,724
<i>Wake up! Wake up. Wake up. Wake up.</i>

404
00:44:45,808 --> 00:44:49,228
<i>Mom! Wake up! Wake up!</i>

405
00:44:49,311 --> 00:44:53,732
<i>Wake up! Wake up! Wake up! Wake up!</i>

406
00:44:55,526 --> 00:44:57,111
<i>Wake up!</i>

407
00:45:00,322 --> 00:45:05,244
[ominous music playing]

408
00:45:28,350 --> 00:45:31,019
<i>Hi, Papa. Your favorite daughter is back.</i>

409
00:45:31,103 --> 00:45:33,897
<i>And by the way, I've already</i>
<i>gained the Triad's support.</i>

410
00:45:34,898 --> 00:45:38,193
[Julio] <i>I want the people</i>
<i>of Ardiente to witness</i>

411
00:45:38,277 --> 00:45:42,197
<i>just how I'll mete out my punishment</i>
<i>and wrath on Lily and Diego.</i>

412
00:45:42,281 --> 00:45:43,657
[gunshots]

413
00:45:43,740 --> 00:45:44,908
<i>Where are Anna and Lily?</i>

414
00:45:44,992 --> 00:45:48,245
[guard] <i>They went to see the relatives</i>
<i>of the Ardientes' other victims.</i>

415
00:45:48,328 --> 00:45:50,247
-[gunshots]
-[Lily] <i>Get away from here.</i>

416
00:45:50,330 --> 00:45:52,875
<i>Go to Diego! Tell him</i>
<i>Julio's men ambushed us.</i>

417
00:45:52,958 --> 00:45:55,377
<i>-Lily, I can't leave you--</i>
<i>-I'll be right behind you.</i>

418
00:45:55,461 --> 00:45:56,420
[thud]

419
00:46:00,716 --> 00:46:03,302
[theme music playing]
